{"3463400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Game Store Chronicle", "steam_appid": 3463400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT IS NOT JUST A SIMULATOR, IT IS PLAYABLE HISTORY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the exciting world of gaming history and run your own game store! This simulation lets you experience the highs and lows of managing a video game shop while immersing yourself in the evolution of gaming through the decades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/a1b9e857496cd7381191bc5eb195c235.poster.avif?t=1787829664\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/a1b9e857496cd7381191bc5eb195c235.webm?t=1787829664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/a1b9e857496cd7381191bc5eb195c235.mp4?t=1787829664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design and Manage Your Store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the very first console launches to the dawn of iconic gaming eras, your store will grow alongside the industry. Organize shelves, create attractive displays, and ensure your shop is the go-to destination for gaming enthusiasts. Make every decision count—your store layout and product selection are key to customer satisfaction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/002ae2b88924eaeea920d35213922969.poster.avif?t=1787829664\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/002ae2b88924eaeea920d35213922969.webm?t=1787829664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/002ae2b88924eaeea920d35213922969.mp4?t=1787829664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Ahead of the Timeline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Game Store Chronicle</i>, the timeline matters. As new gaming generations unfold, iconic consoles, games, and accessories will arrive on the scene. Prepare for these key events, stock the right products at the right time, and ride the wave of excitement to maximize your profits. Anticipating trends and staying ahead of the curve will set you apart from the competition.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stock, Sell, and Strategize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your journey by browsing product catalogs to pick and choose items for your store. Call suppliers to place your orders and receive deliveries. As time progresses, upgrade to more advanced tools like in-game computers to streamline your inventory management. Whether it’s selling the latest console, nostalgic games, or must-have accessories, balancing supply, demand, and customer satisfaction is critical to growing your business.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand and Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As your profits grow, so can your store! Expand your space, upgrade your interiors, and cater to the needs of an ever-growing customer base. Keep up with the ever-changing gaming landscape, adapt to new trends, and ensure your store remains the top choice for gamers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/958fce6c0503cb9200796638fa2425c2.poster.avif?t=1787829664\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/958fce6c0503cb9200796638fa2425c2.webm?t=1787829664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/958fce6c0503cb9200796638fa2425c2.mp4?t=1787829664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dynamic Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every decision you make shapes your business—from product selection to pricing strategies. Will you build a thriving store that becomes a gaming hub, or will you fall behind as trends shift and evolve? The choice is yours in this vibrant simulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/2f5885c1faf3605ea1a7fe5a74eec15b.poster.avif?t=1787829664\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/2f5885c1faf3605ea1a7fe5a74eec15b.webm?t=1787829664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463400/extras/2f5885c1faf3605ea1a7fe5a74eec15b.mp4?t=1787829664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive the golden eras of gaming and carve your place in history. <i>Game Store Chronicle </i>is more than just a business simulator—it’s a nostalgic journey through the evolution of gaming itself. Are you ready to take on the challenge and create the ultimate game store?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT IS NOT JUST A SIMULATOR, IT IS PLAYABLE HISTORY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro